From e66fd1d2ebdf85d12e342ffbfe16f374fcfbffdd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 08:10:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] a body's cancel key is its content print, folded with nothing
 boxed

BodyAt.key() interpolated every field into text on each lookup; the
survey's memos, the walk's seen set, TestsKept.reaching and the fold's
callee diff now key by print(), a two-lane ContentHash, through
HashKeyedTable, so a field added to BodyAt costs no allocation.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QBqJunZcEyAdXLmQJftdiw
